source_note = "Damage 35 / 15 rounds: ARCHITECTURE legacy table. Range 15: PZ Pistol MaxRange. Semi-auto (edge-triggered input), 0.3 s shot interval and 1.5 s reload (rounds move at 80%) proposed; PZ reload/recoil units unverified. Noise 12 tiles proposed (PZ SoundRadius 100 vs bat ~ ratio). Handling (2026-11-10, ours, in proportion to apex-study counterparts P2020 0.225/0.18/x1.0): draw 0.25s, ADS 0.16s at x0.95 move, head x1.5, hip spread 3.5 deg, empty reload 1.8s."
